#NEXUS

[ arbour2015a_fig1: Thyreophoran tree (50% majority rule of Thompson et al. 2012), 27 tips, one polytomy: Zhongyuansaurus + Tsagantegia + the rest of Ankylosauridae. Numbers at nodes are support values. Random-sample case (seed 20261106). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the listed node lines; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=27;
    TAXLABELS
        Lesothosaurus_diagnosticus
        Scutellosaurus_lawleri
        Emausaurus_ernsti
        Scelidosaurus_harrisonii
        Huayangosaurus_taibaii
        Stegosaurus_armatus
        Nodosauridae
